# Run these requests in order with an HTTP client that supports .http files.
# Demo identities are synthetic and only enabled in dev/test.
@base = http://localhost:8080
@patientToken = REPLACE_WITH_LOGIN_ACCESS_TOKEN
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_SUPER_ADMIN_LOGIN_ACCESS_TOKEN
@userId = REPLACE_WITH_REGISTERED_USER_ID
@patientId = REPLACE_WITH_REGISTERED_PATIENT_ID
@minorLinkId = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_LINK_ID
@resetToken = REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN_FROM_MAILPIT

### Verify a patient identity
POST {{base}}/api/v1/identity-verifications
Content-Type: application/json

{"dni":"71234821","name":"Lucía","lastname":"Torres","birthDate":"1995-04-15"}

### Register an adult patient - returns patient ID and user ID
POST {{base}}/api/v1/user-accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{"dni":"71234821","name":"Lucía","lastname":"Torres","birthDate":"1995-04-15","phone":"987654321","email":"lucia@example.test","password":"Demo1!Password"}

### Sign in - copy accessToken to patientToken
POST {{base}}/api/v1/user-accounts/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"lucia@example.test","password":"Demo1!Password","role":"PATIENT"}

### Sign in using DNI - send DNI or email, never both
POST {{base}}/api/v1/user-accounts/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"dni":"71234821","password":"Demo1!Password","role":"PATIENT"}

### Read my profile
GET {{base}}/api/v1/user-accounts/me
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### Update only my own contact details
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/user-accounts/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"lucia@example.test","phone":"912345678"}

### Read my patient profile
GET {{base}}/api/v1/patients/{{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### Link a minor - returns link ID, minor patient ID and tutor patient ID
POST {{base}}/api/v1/patient-minors
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"dni":"87652716","name":"Mateo","lastname":"Torres","birthDate":"2018-04-15","confirmFiliation":true}

### List my minor links
GET {{base}}/api/v1/patients/{{patientId}}/minors
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### Read my minor link
GET {{base}}/api/v1/patient-minors/{{minorLinkId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### Unlink without deleting the patient
DELETE {{base}}/api/v1/patient-minors/{{minorLinkId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### Request recovery - find the email at http://localhost:8025
POST {{base}}/api/v1/user-accounts/recover-password
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"lucia@example.test"}

### Set a new password with the single-use email token (15 minutes)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/user-accounts/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{"token":"{{resetToken}}","password":"Updated1!Password","confirmPassword":"Updated1!Password"}

### Contact support when both email and phone are inaccessible
GET {{base}}/api/v1/account-recovery-requests/support

### Record an assisted recovery request - does not grant access
POST {{base}}/api/v1/account-recovery-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{"dni":"71234821","contactEmail":"lucia-new@example.test"}

### Super admin sign-in - password must match the operator bootstrap configuration
POST {{base}}/api/v1/user-accounts/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@example.test","password":"REPLACE_WITH_BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD","role":"SUPER_ADMIN"}

### Create admission staff - password setup invitation goes to Mailpit
POST {{base}}/api/v1/user-accounts/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"dni":"87654321","name":"Diego","lastname":"Ramos","birthDate":"1990-06-20","phone":"987654321","email":"staff@example.test"}

### Administrator lists requests before verifying the physical DNI
GET {{base}}/api/v1/account-recovery-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Administrator approves only after checking the physical DNI and intended email
POST {{base}}/api/v1/account-recovery-requests/REPLACE_WITH_REQUEST_ID/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"identityCheckedInPerson":true}

### Change my password - obtain a fresh token first if recovery revoked my sessions
POST {{base}}/api/v1/user-accounts/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"currentPassword":"Updated1!Password","password":"Changed1!Password","confirmPassword":"Changed1!Password"}

### Sign out - invalidates only this session
POST {{base}}/api/v1/user-accounts/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
